# The same protein chain as pocket_with_ligand.cif, minus the ligand (and
# minus the DNA residue, which existed only to probe ligand-adjacent
# behaviour). Exists so test_a_structure_with_no_ligand_has_an_empty_pocket
# is not merely "the with-ligand fixture, but I didn't ask it to look" --
# there is no ligand atom in this file for any implementation to find.
#
